        {
          "name": "Choice Scarf",
          "pokemon": "Kyurem-White",
          "shiny": false,
          "gender": "DC",
          "levels": [],
          "description": "<p>Kyurem-W is one of the most dangerous Pokemon in Ubers UU thanks to its combination of high Special Attack, good coverage options, and usable defensive profile, making it one of the tier's most dangerous revenge killers and special attackers. Draco Meteor + Ice Beam is a great STAB combination, hitting the majority of the tier. Freeze-Dry gives Kyurem-W coverage for Water-types like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/palafin/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Palafin</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/toxapex/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Toxapex</a>. Fusion Flare gives Kyurem-White coverage for Steel-types like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/magearna/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Magearna</a>, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/solgaleo/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Solgaleo</a>, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zamazenta-crowned/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zamazenta-C</a>. Tera Fire allows Kyurem-W to boost Fusion Flare as well as provides it with a nifty resistance to Fairy- and Steel-type attacks from the likes of <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zacian/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zacian</a>, Magearna, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/dialga/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Dialga</a>, and Solgaleo. Kyurem-W fits best on balance and offensive teams looking for a strong revenge killer and special attacker. Kyurem-W struggles to break through specially defensive walls like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/blissey/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Blissey</a> and Solgaleo, so Pokemon that can deal with these walls like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus-fire/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus-Fire</a>, Zamazenta-C, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/landorus-therian/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Landorus-T</a>, make good partners. Entry hazard control from Pokemon like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/great-tusk/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Great Tusk</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/corviknight/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Corviknight</a> increases Kyurem-W's longevity.</p>",
          "abilities": [
