        {
          "name": "Choice Specs",
          "pokemon": "Kyurem-White",
          "shiny": false,
          "gender": "DC",
          "levels": [],
          "description": "<p>Choice Specs Kyurem-W is an unparalleled wallbreaker in Ubers UU. Draco Meteor is an nuclear bomb of an attack, easily OHKOing most neutral targets such as <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/dialga/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Dialga</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/mewtwo/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Mewtwo</a>. Ice Beam gives Kyurem-W a strong move versus Fairy-types such as <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zacian/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zacian</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/clefable/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Clefable</a> while also allowing it to hit Ground- and Flying-types, such as <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/great-tusk/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Great Tusk</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/landorus/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Landorus</a>, hard. Freeze-Dry allows Kyurem-W to OHKO <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/palafin/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Palafin</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/palkia-origin/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Palkia-O</a> without dropping its Special Attack with Draco Meteor. Fusion Flare allows Kyurem-W to hit the Steel-types that would otherwise resist Ice and Dragon, such as <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/magearna/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Magearna</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/solgaleo/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Solgaleo</a>. Tera Fire is a must to power up its Fusion Flare while also helping against Zacian and Solgaleo by making its Fairy and Steel weaknesses into resistances. Kyurem-W is incredibly vulnerable to entry hazards due to its Stealth Rock weakness, meaning it appreciates hazard removal from <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/giratina/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Giratina</a> or Great Tusk. Another great teammate that helps with hazard control is <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/hatterene/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Hatterene</a>, due to its immunity to Dragon-type moves helping against <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus-dragon/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus-Dragon</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/garchomp/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Garchomp</a>, as its Magic Bounce ability provides a proactive way of preventing hazards. Kyurem-W also pairs well with slower pivots, such as <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/slowking-galar/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Galarian Slowking</a> and Solgaleo, as they help to get it onto the field safely. Kyurem-W is especially vulnerable to the many faster threats in the metagame, such as Zacian, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zamazenta-crowned/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zamazenta-C</a>, and Palkia-O, so it likes the support of Sticky Web from <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/galvantula/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Galvantula</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/smeargle/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Smeargle</a> or paralysis from Magearna and Giratina.</p>",
          "abilities": [
            "Turboblaze"
